Now that you have learned how to manage Science, Espionage, Special Units and Greater Beings, you will be required to put your skills to use in a game where you must build your Kingdom from scratch. You will begin with only one Fort and one Town. Your King and a few men will be inside the Fort.
To win, you must either destory all of your opponents or you must raise your Military Score to 300, your Population to 600 and your Economic Score to 800.
